{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11112070","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11112070","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1111207001:2":{"text":"우와... 언니 꼬리 정말 폭신하다. 나도 이렇게 폭신한 꼬리가 갖고 싶어!","source_cn":"哇……姐姐，你的尾巴真蓬松啊，我也想要你这样蓬松的尾巴！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92CB6F43CFA48C16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1111207002:2":{"text":"그만 잡아당겨! 그런다고 내 꼬리를 가질 수 있을 것 같아?","source_cn":"别揪了！我的尾巴不可能切下来装在你身上！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x105D227EEE2175F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111207003:2":{"text":"누나, 어디서 왔어? 처음 보는 얼굴이네. 몇 살이야? 누나가 가지고 있는 거 나도 가지고 놀아도 돼?","source_cn":"姐姐，你是哪来的？从来没见过你呢。你多大了？你手里的东...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE82726A684E2271","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111207004:2":{"text":"... 안 돼!","source_cn":"——不可以！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD8B0733F744F6CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1111207005:4":{"text":"뭐 하는 거야? 다들 그만해!","source_cn":"你们在干什么？都给我住手！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7962F7BDACED65D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1111207006:1":{"text":"더는 못 참겠어요! 이 이상한 곳이랑... 아이들, 그리고 현상금 사냥꾼들까지! 지금 당장 여길 떠나야겠어요!","source_cn":"受不了了！看看这个奇怪的地方……一群孩子，还有一群赏金...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEF6780DE050CA25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1111207007:1":{"text":"잠깐, 사트라나!","source_cn":"等等！萨忒娜——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAABBFAC867DB6D96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1111207008:1":{"text":"그리고, 안탄드라, 당신은 꼭 나랑 같이 가야 해요!","source_cn":"至于你！安丹德拉，你必须和我一起走！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74F243EB56C136CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1111207009:1":{"text":"뭐? 일단 진정하고...","source_cn":"什么？你先冷静点……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DDA810882297797","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1111207010:1":{"text":"저 지금 아주 침착해요! 사실 제가 이렇게 고생해서 여기까지 찾아온 건, 당신을 이 사막에서 꺼내주기 위해서라고요!","source_cn":"我很冷静！实话告诉你吧，我千辛万苦来找你，就是为了带你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B710872615F4450","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1111207011:1":{"text":"안탄드라 언니를 데려간다고? 안 돼!","source_cn":"你要带走安丹姐？不许！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76A64577B22CB535","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1111207012:1":{"text":"제가... 미래를 봤으니까요!","source_cn":"因为我看到了——我预见了未来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0832514EE9B8381C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1111207013:1":{"text":"안탄드라는 여기에 있으면 죽을 운명이라고요!","source_cn":"如果她留在这里，等待她的只有死亡！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x597CD73E64991295","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:18:1111207013":{"text":"안탄드라는 여기에 있으면 죽을 운명이라고요!","source_cn":"如果她留在这里，等待她的只有死亡！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x597CD73E64991295","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1111207014:1":{"text":"저도 결코 쉬운 마음으로 운명을 입 밖으로 꺼내는 게 아니에요.","source_cn":"不轻易泄露命运，这是我的准则。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA02909CDE0CE9D09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1111207016:1":{"text":"거짓말쟁이!","source_cn":"骗子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7AA49E581F72D1A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1111207017:1":{"text":"나도 거짓말이었으면 좋겠어. 하지만... 내 예언은 거짓말이 아니야.","source_cn":"我也希望自己是在骗你。很可惜……我的预言，从不撒谎。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x952DC9841FA3A53D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1111207018:1":{"text":"안돼... 안탄드라 언니, 가지 마! 우리를 떠나면 안 돼!","source_cn":"不……安丹姐你别走！你别离开我们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD5822232AD5B53F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1111207019:1":{"text":"괜찮아, 카이. 난 아무데도 안 가.","source_cn":"没事的卡卡，我不会走。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x611472284647FB63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1111207020:1":{"text":"사트라나, 지금 난 여길 떠날 수 없어... 내가 가버리면 누가 이 아이들을 지켜주겠어?","source_cn":"我现在不可能离开……萨忒娜。我走了，谁来保护这些孩子？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A2BE20A9F5D5D30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1111207021:1":{"text":"당신은 항상 다른 사람을 보호하죠! 자신의 안위 따위는 신경도 안 쓰고 늘 다른 사람 걱정만 하잖아요!","source_cn":"你总是在保护别人！每一次我见到你，你都在保护别人！丝毫...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x264A253420DC95E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1111207022:1":{"text":"당신이 다른 사람을 지키면, 당신은 누가 지켜주는데요?","source_cn":"你保护了别人，谁又能保护你？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD93D69E58C8DEE42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1111207023:1":{"text":"내가! 내가 지킬거야!","source_cn":"我！我来保护！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x385183B1E26F614E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1111207024:1":{"text":"꼬맹이가 끼어들 일이 아니야! 내 예언은 틀린 적이 없었어. 특히 안탄드라의 일이라면!","source_cn":"你一个小屁孩，少在那自不量力！从来没有人能打破我的预言...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9746E5BA742DA9B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1111207025:1":{"text":"안 믿어! 안탄드라 언니를 빼앗아 가려고 하는 이... 나쁜 사람!","source_cn":"我不信！你抢走安丹姐姐……是坏人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x391A792620D78FD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:18:0:1":{"text":"정말 입 무겁네!","source_cn":"你的口风可真紧啊！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBA2F3526A02EBA32","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"정말 입 무겁네!","female":"정말 입 무겁네!","variant_male_record_index":"64166","variant_female_record_index":"64167","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1111207015:1":{"text":"저도 이 예언을 믿고 싶지 않았으니까요...","source_cn":"因为我也不愿意相信这则预言……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAC1A9B3B0D6A9B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:18:1:2":{"text":"그걸 왜 이제 말해?","source_cn":"这种事怎么不早说？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAC18F62477FD09F5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그걸 왜 이제 말해?","female":"그걸 왜 이제 말해?","variant_male_record_index":"64168","variant_female_record_index":"64169","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:一脸羡慕的小孩":{"text":"부러워하는 아이","source":"一脸羡慕的小孩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:萨忒娜":{"text":"사트라나","source":"萨忒娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:好奇心重的小孩":{"text":"호기심 많은 아이","source":"好奇心重的小孩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:安丹德拉":{"text":"안탄드라","source":"安丹德拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卡卡":{"text":"카이","source":"卡卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":29,"localized_text_count":28,"speaker_count":5}}